[32m+[m[32m## 🚀 Project Overview[m
 [m
[31m----[m
[32m+[m[32mCustomer churn is a major business challenge for subscription-based companies.[m
 [m
[31m-## Tech Stack[m
[32m+[m[32mThis project builds a complete machine learning solution that:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Predicts whether a customer is likely to churn.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Provides the churn probability.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Explains individual predictions using SHAP.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Supports single-customer prediction.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Supports batch predictions through CSV files.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Provides model performance analysis.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Exposes predictions through a FastAPI REST API.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Provides an interactive Streamlit interface.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Runs through Docker and Docker Compose.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🎯 Business Objective[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe primary objective is to identify customers who are at high risk of churn so that businesses can take proactive retention actions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe platform transforms customer data into:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Customer Data → ML Prediction → Churn Risk → Explanation → Business Decision**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🏗️ System Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32m                     Customer Data[m
[32m+[m[32m                          │[m
[32m+[m[32m                          ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m              ┌────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m              │   Data Preprocessing   │[m
[32m+[m[32m              │   & Feature Engineering│[m
[32m+[m[32m              └────────────┬───────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m                           │[m
[32m+[m[32m                           ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m              ┌────────────────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m              │  Machine Learning      │[m
[32m+[m[32m              │  Model (Random Forest) │[m
[32m+[m[32m              └────────────┬───────────┘[m
[32m+[m[32m                           │[m
[32m+[m[32m              ┌────────────┴────────────┐[m
[32m+[m[32m              ▼                         ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m        Streamlit UI              FastAPI REST API[m
[32m+[m[32m              │                         │[m
[32m+[m[32m       ┌──────┴──────┐                  ▼[m
[32m+[m[32m       ▼             ▼            REST Clients[m
[32m+[m[32mBusiness Users   SHAP[m
[32m+[m[32m                 Explanations[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🧠 Machine Learning Workflow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project follows an end-to-end ML workflow:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Exploratory Data Analysis[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Data Cleaning[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Feature Engineering[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Data Preprocessing[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Train/Test Split[m
[32m+[m[32m6. Model Training[m
[32m+[m[32m7. Model Evaluation[m
[32m+[m[32m8. Explainable AI[m
[32m+[m[32m9. Prediction Services[m
[32m+[m[32m10. Application Development[m
[32m+[m[32m11. API Development[m
[32m+[m[32m12. Dockerization[m
[32m+[m[32m13. Production Testing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 📊 Dataset[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project uses the IBM Telco Customer Churn dataset containing **7,043** customers.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe dataset contains customer demographic, service, contract, billing, and churn-related information. The machine learning model uses customer features available at prediction time to predict the customer's churn status against the binary target column (`Churn Label`).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🤖 Machine Learning Model[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe final model is based on a **Random Forest Classifier**. The performance summary is available in `reports/training_summary.csv`:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Metric | Value |[m
[32m+[m[32m| --- | --- |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Best Model | Random Forest |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Cross-Validation AUC | 0.8602 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Test ROC AUC | 0.853 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Best Prediction Threshold | 0.35 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Precision | 0.5705 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Recall | 0.7246 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| F1 Score | 0.6384 |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe trained artifacts (in `models/`) include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Trained classification model (`final_churn_model.pkl`)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Preprocessing pipeline (`preprocessor.pkl`)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Churn prediction threshold (`best_threshold.pkl`)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🔍 Explainable AI[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSHAP is used to explain individual predictions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe platform provides insight into:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Features increasing churn risk[m
[32m+[m[32m- Features decreasing churn risk[m
[32m+[m[32m- Global feature importance[m
[32m+[m[32m- Individual customer prediction explanations[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis improves model transparency and helps users understand why a prediction was generated.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🖥️ Application Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe Streamlit application is organized into the following pages:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Dashboard[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mProvides an overview of:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Customer churn distribution[m
[32m+[m[32m- Dataset preview[m
[32m+[m[32m- Application status[m
[32m+[m[32m- Loaded model status[m
[32m+[m[32m- Loaded preprocessing pipeline[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Single Prediction[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAllows users to enter individual customer information and receive:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Churn prediction[m
[32m+[m[32m- Churn probability[m
[32m+[m[32m- Risk assessment[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Batch Prediction[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAllows users to upload customer data and generate predictions for multiple customers.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Explainability[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mProvides SHAP-based explanations for model predictions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Model Performance[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDisplays model evaluation results and performance information.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### About[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mProvides project and system information.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🔌 FastAPI REST API[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe project includes a REST API for machine learning predictions.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Available Endpoints[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Method | Endpoint | Description |[m
[32m+[m[32m| --- | --- | --- |[m
[32m+[m[32m| GET | `/` | API information |[m
[32m+[m[32m| GET | `/health` | API health check |[m
[32m+[m[32m| POST | `/predict` | Generate customer churn prediction |[m
[32m+[m[32m| GET | `/docs` | Swagger API documentation |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m`POST /predict` accepts a JSON object of raw customer features and returns the churn `prediction`, churn `probability`, and a `risk` assessment (`Low` / `Medium` / `High`).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🐳 Docker[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe application is containerized using Docker and orchestrated with Docker Compose.[m
[32m+[m
