[32m+[m[32m| --- | --- | --- | --- |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Streamlit | `churn-streamlit` | 8501 | http://localhost:8501 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| FastAPI | `churn-api` | 8000 | http://localhost:8000 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Swagger Documentation | — | 8000 | http://localhost:8000/docs |[m
